            <h3>Outcomes</h3>
            <p>At a company with thousands of developers, every saved moment was multiplied massively. As a result,</p>  <p class="pquote">...our work (in its first 100 days) saved 200 hours<br /> or 25 <em>days</em> of developer time <em>each day it was in use.</em></p>
            <p>(I also cleaned up and tokenized the team's pattern library and design files.<br /> Because I believe in the campsite rule. :)</p>
        
